abstract: >-
  A kill rule for training runs with a conformal bound on the expected fraction of runs that
  were good and got killed, or on the probability that a good run is killed. Includes a numpy
  KillRule, an Optuna ConformalPruner, and the 400 LoRA fine-tuning curves from the
  pre-registered experiment CC-03c, with scripts that reproduce the recorded numbers exactly
  and compare the rule with median pruning and successive halving.
